==============================================================================================================
⚠️ LIMITS
==============================================================================================================
  · ⛔ UNTRAINED weights. This measures the stage's GEOMETRY, not what training does with
    it. A trained candidate could re-learn a phase pattern a 2x2 kernel permits.
  · ⛔ TEACHER-FORCED (C-399), to match M92. The arm is scored autoregressively, and
    EXP-01's whole finding is that the two do not agree.
  · ⚠️ One seed. The architecture difference is deterministic given the seed, but the
    MAGNITUDE of each gap is a one-draw quantity with no sigma-hat.
  · sb head (head1) only; up0/up1/out on the reg branch.

